sequenceDiagram
    participant CK as Cesium Clock
    participant TC as TimeController
    participant TS as TimeSlicer
    participant WK as Optional Worker
    participant HB as Heatbox
    participant RP as RenderPlanner
    participant GR as GeometryRenderer
    participant EC as viewer.entities

    CK->>TC: onTick(currentTime)
    TC->>TC: wall-clock throttle
    alt in-memory synchronous path
        TC->>TS: getEntry(currentTime)
        TS-->>TC: time slice or null
    else lazy or worker-enabled path
        TC->>TC: allocate request id
        TC->>TS: getEntryAsync(currentTime)
        opt lazy data is needed
            TS->>TS: request and merge entries
        end
        opt gap interpolation with worker enabled
            TS->>WK: interpolate plain numeric data
            WK-->>TS: result or main-thread fallback
        end
        TS-->>TC: time slice or null
        TC->>TC: reject stale or inactive result
    end
    TC->>TC: coalesce updates, latest slice wins
    TC->>HB: updateValues(slice data)
    alt current grid remains valid
        HB->>HB: reuse grid and reclassify
    else bounds changed or processing failed
        HB->>HB: setData full rebuild
    end
    HB->>RP: plan using current camera state
    RP-->>HB: prioritized bounded set
    HB->>GR: beginFrame, syncVoxel, endFrame
    GR->>EC: add, update, and remove Entities

    Note over TS,WK: Worker preprocessing is interpolation only
    Note over HB,EC: Cesium rendering stays on the main thread
